  "description": "n8n Monitoring Pack: n8n — Workflows. Imported from https://github.com/n8n-io/solutions-catalog/blob/9a6253b00638f6ca0549980e74a1426f67c9b9e8/validation/dashboards/dashboards/portable/n8n-business.json (commit 9a6253b) by dashboards/import-monitoring-pack.py; see that script for the local adaptations. Upstream note: Portable build. Datasource, n8n scrape job, namespace and Postgres database are template variables, so this file imports unchanged onto the Talos lab or onto EKS. PgBouncer panels query CloudNativePG's names with a fallback to prometheus-pgbouncer-exporter's, both verified. On multi-main EKS the n8n queue metrics report nothing by design; use the Queue & Workers dashboard, which reads Redis directly.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
